ecca006f5791))(instances (project "P11" (path "/56431b85-0c1b-589c-8e56-b9df883db6f9" (reference "X6") (unit 1)))))(text "J_P12: IDC 2x10 KATOWE do P12 (S1 8, PANELCORE + PANELSAFE), na krawedzi P11 od sciany A (P11 poziomo na dnie strefy panelu). Piny 10/13/14/15/16 jak P03 R6 J_BP1 (N_J_SCOPE_HOT, MARK, TEST_KEY, LOGGER_CLEAR, TEST_PRESENT)." (at 20.32 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid 2bb89ce0-9c26-5c69-a653-17a26c75e818))(text "Nieparzyste GND poza 13 MARK i 15 LOGGER_CLEAR (wyjatek jak w P03 R6). 12 i 18 GND (rezerwa). 3V3_IO na 20 - z dala od PANEL_3V3 (pin 2)." (at 20.32 39.37 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid c3978d5a-f99f-5b2a-9e8e-5bfc3cb9d565))(text "PANELSAFE do P04 (wariant pelny): PANEL_3V3 2, MECH_OK 4, STOP_NC_OUT 6, ARM_CONTACT 8, TEST_KEY 14 (wspolny z P03). W LOGGER piny 4/6/8 bez odbiornika." (at 20.32 48.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid 269060b3-3e96-55b3-953e-3493523aaa7d))(text "R1 100R (decyzja P11-3): LOGGER bez P04 = OBSADZONY. Wariant z P04 = DNP (nie montowac): PANEL_3V3 zasila wtedy tylko P04 R40 100R z 3V3_IO." (at 177.8 101.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid c3227f82-6f7a-54b3-8d74-c84cc839fe1e))(text "Obsadzony R1 przy P04 = dwa zrodla (2 x 100R rownolegle): znika ograniczenie pradu R40. Brak R1 bez P04 = TEST_KEY, LOGGER_CLEAR, TEST_PRESENT zawsze L." (at 177.8 110.49 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid 23892d3a-b884-5889-af2b-2ebe8e171826))(text "Zwarcie PANEL_3V3-GND przy R1: 34 mA, 0.12 W w 1206 (0.25 W). Odbiorniki 3 x 10k do GND na P03 R6 (R27, R6, R8); MARK: 10k do 3V3_CORE na P03 R6." (at 177.8 119.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid 74ad4523-fad3-5c59-a1da-167a24a07e93))(text "SCOPE: N_J_SCOPE_HOT z P03 R6 przez R12 330R. BNC izolowany, odbiornik >= 1 Mohm, bez terminacji 50R. Ekran = GND." (at 177.8 190.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uu